<title>POLAND: BYTOM SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 93,800.</title>
<headline>BYTOM SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 93,800.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.01 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.17 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.76 vs   0.95</p>
<p> Sales		    8.36 vs   8.32</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.26 vs   2.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.62 vs   3.35</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.61 vs   6.32</p>
<p> Sales		   59.87 vs  54.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
